{#
  Static map for a post's location, linked to OpenStreetMap. A plain <img> (NOT the local-only {% image %} shortcode, and NOT a WebC component): the eleventy-img HTML transform runs BEFORE the WebC transform, so only a Nunjucks-emitted <img> gets fetched + self-hosted — a WebC-emitted one would ship the raw keyed URL. Same remote-cover pattern as reading/watching/jam.

  - `src | safe`                       keeps the multi-param URL's literal '&' (an
                                       escaped '&amp;' makes eleventy-img fetch a
                                       404 → fatal build — see the eleventy-excellent
                                       remote-image note).
  - `eleventy:optional="placeholder"`  a failed fetch (bad key, quota, outage) becomes
                                       a placeholder, so the keyed URL is never left
                                       in the HTML.

  Bare-include-friendly: no async shortcode, so the interlinker {% if %}-blank trap doesn't apply even though photo.njk wraps this include in {% if showMap %}. This is the no-JS fallback for the <place-map> element — 16:9 to match the live map that replaces it on idle; zoom matches place-map.js's default.

  The CALLER supplies the coordinates, so the same partial serves any post type that knows where it happened — photo.njk passes them from EXIF, audio.njk from front matter. Expects in context: mapLat, mapLon, meta.mapApiKey; optionally mapZoom, mapPlace, and mapSubject (the "where this ___" clause in the alt text).
#}
{%- set mz = mapZoom or 13 -%}
{%- set mapSubject = mapSubject or "this was recorded" -%}
{%- set center = mapLon ~ "," ~ mapLat -%}
{# style=positron (minimal light-grey, theme-agnostic); marker = --color-accent-orange (#d0621e). #}
{%- set mapSrc = "https://maps.geoapify.com/v1/staticmap?style=positron&width=1280&height=720&center=lonlat:" ~ center ~ "&zoom=" ~ mz ~ "&marker=lonlat:" ~ center ~ ";type:material;color:%23d0621e;size:large&apiKey=" ~ meta.mapApiKey -%}
{%- set mapOsm = "https://www.openstreetmap.org/?mlat=" ~ mapLat ~ "&mlon=" ~ mapLon ~ "#map=" ~ mz ~ "/" ~ mapLat ~ "/" ~ mapLon -%}
<a class="place-map-static no-indicator" href="{{ mapOsm }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
  <img eleventy:optional="placeholder" src="{{ mapSrc | safe }}" alt="Map showing where {{ mapSubject }}{% if mapPlace %}, near {{ mapPlace }}{% endif %}" loading="lazy" eleventy:widths="640,1280" sizes="(min-width: 82rem) 72rem, 100vw">
</a>
